              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ekaŋ iyes ŋiketatamak a Ŋikisila! Iwua iyes ekipuŋguwo ŋolo eŋae akai ŋina eyai aosou; tari iyes ŋilopeyek nyelomara, nabo iretakis iyes tari ŋulu acamito alomar!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.52"
            ]
