            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani erotokini Yesu a nen, tolomakis ŋiketatamak a Ŋikisila ka Ŋiparisayon akisirwor iŋes neni aronon nooi ka akiŋitiŋit iŋes ŋakiro ŋuna alalak nooi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
